{"id":"aabd59bbace390a1","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md","title":"Ackermann Not Primitive Recursive","display":"thm-ackermann-not-pr — Ackermann Not Primitive Recursive","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-ackermann-not-pr","aliases":["88-thm-ackermann-not-pr"],"display":"thm-ackermann-not-pr — Ackermann Not Primitive Recursive","depends_on":["[[88-df-ackermann-function]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-ackermann-not-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-ackermann-not-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ackermann-not-pr — Ackermann Not Primitive Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a89fca2dc3b5b5cb\" href=\"?note=a89fca2dc3b5b5cb\" title=\"88-df-ackermann-function\">88-df-ackermann-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (Ackermann function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a89fca2dc3b5b5cb\" href=\"?note=a89fca2dc3b5b5cb\" title=\"88-df-ackermann-function\">88-df-ackermann-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)\\)</span> (primitive-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}not\\text{-}pr} \\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}not\\text{-}pr} \\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> : Ackermann函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\)</span> : 原始递归函数谓词</li>\n<li>Ackermann函数的适当切片最终支配每个一元原始递归函数，因此它不是\n原始递归函数。</li>\n<li>证明原始递归函数类有严格界限</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ackermann-function","status":"resolved","id":"a89fca2dc3b5b5cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ackermann-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ackermann-function","status":"resolved","id":"a89fca2dc3b5b5cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ (Ackermann function, see [[88-df-ackermann-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)$ (primitive-recursive predicate, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ackermann\\text{-}not\\text{-}pr} \\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}","display":false}],"bytes":891,"backlinks":[{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[88-thm-completeness.md]]\n[[88-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict-def.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-recursion.md]]\n[[88-thm-lob.md]]\n[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md]]\n[[88-thm-ls-upward.md]]\n[[88-thm-partial-tm-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-problem-solved.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-theorem.md]]\n[[88-thm-pr-total.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice-proof.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice.md]]\n[[88-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-sigma1-complete.md]]\n[[88-thm-smn.md]]\n[[88-thm-soundness.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-equals-recursive.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-recursive.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a89fca2dc3b5b5cb","2f808bc294509a7d"]}